Package: trufflehog
Version: 3.96.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vaizer0
Depends: git, golang
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Vaizer0/zero-termux
Description: Find leaked credentials and secrets in code and data
 TruffleHog scans Git repositories, file systems, and other sources
 to detect accidentally exposed secrets, API keys, passwords, and
 other sensitive data using entropy analysis and regex patterns.
